  <!-- EN: Specialized warcasket helmet with superior protection and worse weight, sealed behind a respirator that keeps out tox gas and draws it back into the shell's tank.\n\nThe 7th generation warcaskets came after underwhelming results in improving the baseline performance even further, instead focusing on creating designs that - while interchangeable - work better as a set. They were also the first to include plasteel in the design as it appeared more frequently in scavenging and looting. Each piece has a unique function that synergises with those of the same series, making them a truly separate class of mobile armor units.\n\nThe Toxin series is based on the Cataphract design, rebuilt for chemical warfare. A tank in the shell feeds vents around the pilot and gas jets on the pauldrons, and the helmet's respirator draws gas back into the tank. Together the pieces make the pilot immune to environmental toxins. -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.description>特化型战棺头盔，在增加机体重量的同时大幅提升了防护性。头盔由呼吸器密封，既能阻隔毒气，也能把毒气抽回装甲的毒气罐。\n\n由于机体基本性能的强化陷入瓶颈，第七代战棺的研发重心转向了创新改进方面。虽然机体部件仍可以进行自由搭配，但配套组装显然才是最优选项，同型号部件间的协作增效使它们真正成为了功能分明的机动装甲部队。第七代也是首批采用玻璃钢进行组装的战棺，因为在拾荒与劫掠时总能收获到许多这种材料。\n\n毒素型以骑士型的设计为基础，专为化学战改造而成。装甲内的毒气罐为驾驶员周身的排气阀和护肩上的喷口供气，头盔的呼吸器则把毒气抽回罐中。整套穿戴时，驾驶员对环境毒素免疫。</TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.description>
  <!-- EN: toxin warcasket helmet -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.label>毒素型战棺头盔</TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized warcasket helmet with superior protection and worse weight, sealed behind a respirator that keeps out tox gas and draws it back into the shell's tank. -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.shortDescription>特化型战棺头盔，在增加机体重量的同时大幅提升了防护性。头盔由呼吸器密封，既能阻隔毒气，也能把毒气抽回装甲的毒气罐。</TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.shortDescription>

  <!-- EN: jet -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.chargeNoun>喷射</TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.cooldownGerund>冷却中</TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: Spray a cone of tox gas from the shoulders toward the target. The gas lands in the inner cone and drifts over the outer area, thinning as it goes. Each jet draws on the warcasket's tank. Without a tank, the shoulders fall back on jets of their own, reloaded with chemfuel. -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetDescription>从护肩向目标喷出锥形毒气。毒气落在内侧锥形区域，再向外侧区域飘散，越飘越稀薄。每次喷射都从战棺的毒气罐中抽取。没有毒气罐时，护肩改用自身储备的喷射，以化合燃料装填。</TXWC_WarcasketShoulders_Toxin.comps.CompJetNozzle.jetDescription>
